Brand color accurate display list
title end

paragraph start
A monochrome look depends on how blacks and greys appear. An accurate display helps judge them, but every design is also checked on a phone, because viewers watch on phones.
paragraph end

paragraph start
A calibrated display is a nice to have until the brand sells printed goods, then it becomes a must.
paragraph end

